PATTERNS
Zero
OneNine
TenPlus [>:>] Over [>:>] OneNine
TenPlus [>:>] Over [>:>] FractUnit [>:>] Fraction
Tens ([>:>] Fraction)?
HundredBy [>:>] TwoNine ([>:>] Fraction)?
TenDeg ([>:>] Fraction)?
TwoNine [>:>] Fraction
OneFive [>:>] Layer
[<100>:щэ] [>:>] Half
DistrRy
DistrFull
HigherPowers [>:-] DistrPower
HigherPowers[-hundred] [>:-] DistrTen

PATTERN OneNine
One | TwoFive | SixNine

PATTERN TwoNine
TwoFive | SixNine

PATTERN OneFive
One | TwoFive

PATTERN TenDeg
Ten | HigherPowers

PATTERN Tens
TensStem[lit] [>:>] TenBy[lit]
TensStem[kub] [>:>] TenBy[kub]
TensStem[malk] [>:>] TenBy[malk]
TensStem[bes] [>:>] TenBy[bes]
TensIrregular

PATTERN Fraction
Fract ([>:>] TwoNine)?

PATTERN FractUnit
OneNine[-eight] | FractEight

PATTERN DistrRy
One [>:>] Distr [>:>] Reduplication :One
DistrTwoNine
DistrTen

PATTERN DistrTwoNine
TwoFive [>:>] Distr [>:>] Reduplication :TwoFive
SixNine[-eight] [>:>] Distr [>:>] Reduplication :SixNine[-eight]
DistrEight

PATTERN DistrTen
Ten [>:>] Distr [>:>] Reduplication :Ten

PATTERN DistrPower
PowerOneDistr
DistrTwoNine

PATTERN DistrFull
TenPlus [>:>] Over [>:>] One FullRepeat :TenPlus :Over :One
TenPlus [>:>] Over [>:>] TwoFive FullRepeat :TenPlus :Over :TwoFive
TenPlus [>:>] Over [>:>] SixNine FullRepeat :TenPlus :Over :SixNine
TensStem[lit] [>:>] TenBy[lit] FullRepeat :TensStem[lit] :TenBy[lit]
TensStem[kub] [>:>] TenBy[kub] FullRepeat :TensStem[kub] :TenBy[kub]
TensStem[malk] [>:>] TenBy[malk] FullRepeat :TensStem[malk] :TenBy[malk]
TensStem[bes] [>:>] TenBy[bes] FullRepeat :TensStem[bes] :TenBy[bes]
TensIrregular FullRepeat :TensIrregular
HundredBy [>:>] TwoFive FullRepeat :HundredBy :TwoFive
HundredBy [>:>] SixNine FullRepeat :HundredBy :SixNine
HigherPowers FullRepeat :HigherPowers

